    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "team_0060_select_01",
      "hash64": "FE4584CC0003AA7A",
      "text": "Encore vous, monsieur Clavel ?",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "team_0060_select_02",
      "hash64": "FE4583CC0003A8C7",
      "text": "Clove ?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "team_0060_nelke_02",
      "hash64": "FD96731F923FB0DE",
      "text": "Monsieur qui ?\\nMoi, c’est Clove. Ton vieux pote. Souviens-t’en.[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 63,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "team_0060_nelke_03",
      "hash64": "FD96741F923FB291",
      "text": "Oui, c’est bien moi, Clove. Ton vieux pote.\\nTu joues le jeu, c’est très « cool ».[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 81,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "team_0060_nelke_04",
      "hash64": "FD96751F923FB444",
      "text": "Tu tombes à pic. On va pouvoir reprendre\\nnotre conversation de la dernière fois.[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 80,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "team_0060_nelke_05",
      "hash64": "FD96761F923FB5F7",
      "text": "Comme je te le disais, si l’Opération Stardust\\nm’intéresse tant, c’est parce que je veux\\r\\ncomprendre ce qui se passe avec les membres\\r\\nde la Team Star, et la raison de leurs actions.[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 88,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 135,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 186,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "team_0060_nelke_06",
      "hash64": "FD96771F923FB7AA",
      "text": "Je veux savoir pourquoi les élèves de\\ncette bande sèchent les cours.[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 68,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "team_0060_nelke_07",
      "hash64": "FD96781F923FB95D",
      "text": "Rejoindre la cause de Cassiopée, qui souhaite\\ndissoudre leur organisation, est donc un excellent\\r\\nmoyen pour moi d’atteindre cet objectif.[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 96,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 140,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "team_0060_nelke_08",
      "hash64": "FD96691F923F9FE0",
      "text": "Et pour preuve, en participant à cette opération,\\nj’ai enfin pu approcher la Team Star.[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "team_0060_nelke_09",
      "hash64": "FD966A1F923FA193",
      "text": "J’ai eu l’occasion de parler avec eux, ce qui m’a\\npermis de comprendre beaucoup de choses...[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "team_0060_nelke_10",
      "hash64": "FD99F71F9242C701",
      "text": "Mais j’ai besoin de plus d’infos.[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 33,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "team_0060_nelke_11",
      "hash64": "FD99F61F9242C54E",
      "text": "Et pour ça, je dois aussi rencontrer les membres\\ndes autres groupes de la Team Star.[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 84,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "team_0060_nelke_12",
      "hash64": "FD99F51F9242C39B",
      "text": "Tu peux compter sur moi pour te donner un coup\\nde main, quand tu iras au prochain repaire.\\c\\nSur ce, « à tôt-bien », [VAR 0x0100(0000)].[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
